msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"You want me to tell you again? Didn't you write everything\r\n"
"down in that notebook of yours? Just read your notes and\r\n"
"quit bothering me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "I live for this first drink after work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"(I should go see the people related to the case, the ones\r\n"
"written down in that notebook...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Detective Maeda, of the Kamurocho Police?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Hm...?"
msgstr "Mmm..."

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"What a surprise. If it isn't the fourth chairman of the\r\n"
"Tojo Clan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "You know who I am?"
msgstr "Sai chi sono io?"

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Hey, you're famous in this town. So what does the Fourth\r\n"
"Chairman want with me, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"I wanna ask you about the Café Alps murder from six years\r\n"
"ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Oh, that shitstorm? Yeah, that was my case. Why'd you want\r\n"
"to reopen that can of worms now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"I'm trying to find out whether Yuichi Akechi really\r\n"
"committed that murder or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "What? Are you saying you think he was falsely charged?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Not a chance in hell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "No? Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"We aren't stupid, ya know. The police don't arrest people\r\n"
"without proof."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "We had plenty of evidence saying Akechi was the murderer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "What kind of evidence?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "We had..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"<Color:7>Alibis<Color:Default>, <Color:7>witness statements<Color:Default>, "
"<Color:7>fingerprints<Color:Default>, and <Color:7>a motive<Color:Default>. "
"That did it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"You've got all that evidence? Could you tell me a little\r\n"
"bit more about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Sure, I guess... Well, don't just stand there. Have a seat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "(Let's see. What to ask...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Tell me about the alibis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"As part of our initial investigation, we interviewed everyone\r\n"
"who may have been involved in the crime. In the end, <Color:7>the only person without one was Akechi<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "Nobody else could've murdered Oda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"(Guess we've got two choices. Either we <Color:7>find Yuichi an alibi<Color:Default>\r\n"
"<Color:7>or find a flaw in one of the others<Color:Default>...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Tell me about witness statements."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"<Color:7>Somebody witnessed Yuichi Akechi fleeing the<Color:Default>\r\n"
"<Color:7>scene<Color:Default> just after the crime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "I heard about that. The waiter⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"<Color:7>Masaru Kinoshita<Color:Default>? He gave a statement saying he saw "
"Akechi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid ""
"(If it was me, I'd probably think Yuichi did it, too...\r\n"
"I wonder how I can refute Kinoshita's statement...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "Tell me about the motive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Yuichi Akechi had plenty of motive to kill the victim, Oda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"You mean because Oda was sleeping with Yuichi's girlfriend,\r\n"
"Sawako Usami?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"Bingo. And we didn't find anybody else who might've had a\r\n"
"reason to kill Oda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"(<Color:7>So they didn't find anybody else<Color:Default>, huh? But what if someone\r\n"
"else DID have a reason to kill Oda...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "Tell me about the fingerprints."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "The deciding factor in Akechi's arrest was his fingerprints."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"We took and compared <Color:7>fingerprints<Color:Default> from each employee with\r\n"
"those <Color:7>found on the murder weapon<Color:Default>, but the only ones that matched\r\n"
"were <Color:7>Akechi's<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"We concluded that the other prints came from café customers,\r\n"
"and so were unrelated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"(That sounds like pretty conclusive evidence... Was Akechi\r\n"
"really the only person involved who had fingerprints on\r\n"
"the murder weapon?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "So there you go. Solid evidence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"But if you think we made a mistake, I'd sure like to\r\n"
"hear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid ""
"(Hmm. Not enough to go on right now... Guess I'd better\r\n"
"take a closer look into everything that was going on\r\n"
"at the time.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"Do you know what the Café Alps staff from back then are\r\n"
"doing nowadays?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid ""
"Sure. I can tell you that much, but I doubt you'll get\r\n"
"anything new from them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"<Color:7>You wrote the whereabouts of the people related<Color:Default>\r\n"
"<Color:7>to the case in the Notebook<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid "(Guess my next step is to go visit the people involved.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid ""
"(The Florist might know something, too. I should go talk to\r\n"
"him.)"
msgstr ""

